  DigitsClockwise: 04000000070000000200000009000000010000000600000008000000000000000500000003000000i
  WheelInstructions: Take the bearing of the radio, the sun and the weather vane from the dial. Enter their digits in the order engraved on the chest. Use the vane's position, not the direction of its blade.
  LockInstructions: Read the marks from left to right. Click a wheel to turn it. Enter to try the latch. Esc to step back.
  UnlockedText: The catch gives. Press E to take the tablet inside.
